# The model picker offers the selected Codex model's thinking depth and speed,
# named as their menus name them, and keeps the choices; Claude's default model
# has no speed to choose and thinks deeply by default.
# iOS: testSimulatorComposerOffersFastModelAndEffortBeforeMicrophone (the Mac
# shows them in T3 Code's picker rather than the composer's bar)
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
press "Fixture Model" 20000
expect "モデルを検索" 10000
expect "思考の深さ: medium"
expect "速度: 通常"
press "速度: 通常"
press 高速
expect "速度: 高速" 10000
press "速度: 高速"
press 通常
expect "速度: 通常" 10000
press "思考の深さ: medium"
press high
expect "思考の深さ: high" 10000
screenshot codex-controls
key escape
expect_absent "モデルを検索" 10000
press "Fixture Model"
expect "思考の深さ: high" 10000
press "Claude Code"
press アカウントと週間残量
press アカウントを追加
type 認証コード "fixture-code" 15000
press サインインを完了
expect "claude@example.invalidを選択中" 20000
press 閉じる
press "Default (recommended)"
press "Default (recommended)"
expect "モデルを検索" 10000
expect_absent "速度:"
expect "思考の深さ: high"
screenshot claude-controls
